 30	// NOTE: ProbesRenderer is an independent baking service that runs asynchronously in the background.
 31	// It does NOT need to be integrated into the RenderGraph architecture because:
 32	// 1. It's not part of the per-frame rendering pipeline
 33	// 2. It handles environment probe and sky light baking with its own scheduling and timeout logic
 34	// 3. Probes are baked on-demand and cached for later use
 35	// 4. It uses its own SceneRenderTask for rendering cubemap faces
